<item>
            <title>[IGNITE-9454] SecurityPermissionSetBuilder fails to append system permission CACHE_CREATE</title>
                <link>https://issues.apache.org/jira/browse/IGNITE-9454</link>
                <project id="12315922" key="IGNITE">Ignite</project>
                    <description>&lt;p&gt;SecurityPermissionSetBuilder fails to append system permission CACHE_CREATE, CACHE_DESTROY and JOIN_AS_SERVER&lt;/p&gt;

&lt;p&gt;&lt;ins&gt;&lt;b&gt;Reproducer&lt;/b&gt;&lt;/ins&gt;:&lt;/p&gt;

&lt;p&gt;SecurityPermissionSetBuilder.create().appendSystemPermission(SecurityPermission.CACHE_CREATE)&lt;/p&gt;

&lt;p&gt;The code above throw IgniteException saying that a security permission name should&#160;begin with either EVENTS_ or ADMIN_&lt;/p&gt;

&lt;p&gt;&lt;b&gt;&lt;ins&gt;Solution&lt;/ins&gt;:&lt;/b&gt;&lt;/p&gt;

&lt;p&gt;Update&#160;SecurityPermissionSetBuilder to:&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ol&gt;
	&lt;li&gt;allow system permissions&#160;CACHE_CREATE, CACHE_DESTROY and JOIN_AS_SERVER&lt;/li&gt;
	&lt;li&gt;restrict cache presmissions&#160;CACHE_CREATE, CACHE_DESTROY&lt;/li&gt;
	&lt;li&gt;add automated tests&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ol&gt;


&lt;p&gt;&#160;&lt;/p&gt;</description>
